    oa:article <https://www.orionsarm.com/eg-article/4799653855bdd> ;
    oa:kind "planet" ;
    oa:labelsSystem false ;
    oa:note "In Hydra at 2,550 ly, and held jointly — a Sophic League and Caretaker Gods stewardship, which is why both are recorded." ;
